Value day_of_week (.*)
Value month (.*)
Value day (.*)
Value time (.*)
Value year (.*)

# Parse the output of "show time" on an HP AOS-S switch.
#
# A single line such as "Wed Sep  2 22:29:02 2026" (note the double space
# before single-digit days because the day field is right-aligned to two
# columns). \s+ absorbs the variable spacing.


Start
  ^\s*(?P<day_of_week>\w{3})\s+(?P<month>\w{3})\s+(?P<day>\d{1,2})\s+(?P<time>\d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2})\s+(?P<year>\d{4})\s*$ -> Record
